<title>USA: Landstar to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Landstar to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landstar System Inc said Monday it had authorized the repurchase of up to 1.5 million common shares from time to time in the open market and in privately-negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company currently has 12.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to amend provisions of its credit facility in the &quot;near future&quot; that limit the amount of stock it may purchase in any given year.</p>
<p>Landstar said it had authorized the new program because it believes its stock is undervalued and the propgram advances long-term objectives of maximizing shareholder value.</p>
</text>
